  "chapter": {
    "number": 2,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Therefore did the heathen rage, and the nations imagine vain things?",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The kings of the earth stood up, and the rulers gathered themselves together, against the Lord, and against his Christ;",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "saying, Let us break through their bonds, and cast away their yoke from us.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 4,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "He that dwells in the heavens shall laugh them to scorn, and the Lord shall mock them.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 5,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Then shall he speak to them in his anger, and trouble them in his fury.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 6,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "But I have been made king by him on Sion his holy mountain,",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 7,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "declaring the ordinance of the Lord: the Lord said to me, You are my Son, today have I begotten you.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 8,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Ask of me, and I will give you the heathen for your inheritance, and the ends of the earth for your possession.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 9,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "You shall",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "noteId": 3
          },
          {
            "text": "rule them with a rod of iron; you shall dash them in pieces as a potter's vessel.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 10,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Now therefore understand, you⌃ kings: be instructed, all you⌃ that judge the earth.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 11,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Serve the Lord with fear, and rejoice in him with trembling.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 12,
        "content": [
          {
            "noteId": 4
          },
          {
            "text": "Accept correction, lest at any time the Lord be angry, and you⌃ should perish from the righteous way: whenever his wrath shall be suddenly kindled, blessed are all they that trust in him.",
            "poem": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnotes": [
      {
        "noteId": 3,
        "caller": "+",
        "text": "Gr. tend them as a shepherd. Rev. 2:27.",
        "reference": {
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 9
        }
      },
      {
        "noteId": 4,
        "caller": "+",
        "text": "Note. - This rendering or a similar one the Jews maintain.",
        "reference": {
